WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Responsiveness and position.

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:07.659
Tap the shoulders firmly and ask loudly whether the casualty is okay.

00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:11.923
Do not shake violently or move the neck unnecessarily.

00:00:11.923 --> 00:00:23.452
Effective CPR needs the casualty on their back on a firm, flat surface; if turning is required, support and turn the head, neck and body together.
